The list of changes and improvements in the update:

Some mistakes in the Tåtar(Tatar) localization were fixed;

The ending credits were edited again.

The quick list of the changes in this version:

The ending credits were edited;

Removed a debug text object.

The list of changes and additions:

Added the kerning after the Latin letters b, c, e, g, j, k, o, p, r, v, y, x, and Å;

The ending credits text became more readable.

The list of chnages:

The ending credits have been edited;

The heights of the Latin letters c, ć, ĉ, č, ç, ȼ, ḉ; and the heights of the Cyrillic letters с, ҫ, э, ӭ, and є have been fixed;

The widths of the Cyrillic letters ұ and ү have been fixed;

The spaces after the dot and the comma have been fixed;

The authors' names of the game in the ending credits were translater into Tåtar/Tatar language;

Added the kerning after the Cyrillic letters Ң, А, Ә, Б, В, Г, Д, Ж, Җ, З, К, Л, М, О, Ө, Р, С, Т, У, Ү, Ф, Х, Һ, Ц, Щ, Ъ, Ь, Э, Ю, ә, б, в, г, д, е, ё, ж, җ, з, к, л, ң, о, ө, р, с, т, у, ү, ф, х, ц, ъ, ь, and э;

Added the kerning after the Latin letters A, B, C, D, I, J, K, L, M, O, P, R, S, T, U, V, W, X, Y, and Z;

And some minor improvements.

The version 1.2.08 patch notes:

The Tåtar (officially Tatar) localization was completely remade by real humans;

Old mouse icon is back;

Fixed some mistakes in the English (the USA) localization;

Fixed some mistakes in the Nёw Englīš localization;

Fixed some mistakes in the Russian localization;

Replaced the old font with a new one.

The patch notes for the 1.2.02 version:
Added the instruction to the start menu about using a gamepad;

Fixed a not hiding extra text after beginning to drive a car.

The patch notes for the 1.2 version:              ːsteamhappyː
Added the Kazakh localization;

Added the Brazilian Portuguese localization;

Added the Turkish localization;

Added the Ukrainian localization;

Fixed some mistakes in the Tåtar(officially Tatar) localization;

Fixed some mistakes in the Russian localization;

Fixed some mistakes in the English localization;

Fixed some mistakes in the Nёw Englīš localization;

Fixed wrong position of the trigger of the buttons "Buy the car", "Choose the car", and "Tune the chosen car";

Fixed color of the text "Fullscreen" so that it is better seen;

Removed trees stricking out from the road;

Added the Input System which allows a better support of controllers;

Fixed the checkpoints because of which a car was respawned under the ground in the 17th and 18th races;

Added the checkpoints' bounds, so that there is a smaller chance to miss one;

